SUMMARY="A document viewer for PDF and other document formats"
DESCRIPTION="A document viewer for the GNOME desktop. You can view, search or annotate documents \
in many different formats.

Papers supports documents in: PDF, DjVu, TIFF, and Comic Books archives (CBR, CBT, CBZ, CB7)."
